    "limitations": "The mapped pavilion footprint and its southern approach establish geographic fit and heading. The open brick vault, roof heights and paving perimeter are photo estimates. Standard Terrarium terrain gives the pavilion a partly banked rear wall. Foundation bottoms follow the sampled grade. Nearby park paths and land cover remain in place. The source master includes the below-grade burial chamber, dromos and antechamber from the published section image. The concentric bands and figures are an original simplified reconstruction. Chamber depth within the protective building is estimated. The exterior LODs omit below-grade geometry, and the native site remains closed. The visitor replica stays a separate mapped point. The model sign reproduces the English wording. Physical-device timings remain unmeasured."
